{
    "title": "Calm Color Coloring games",
    "description": "Color by number a day, leave your stress away!\ud83d\ude04\ud83d\ude04  \r\n\r\nBring out your inner artist with Fun Color - Happy Coloring Games. This digital coloring book app provides over 5000 intricate coloring pages and color by number templates for you to paint by number. \ud83d\udd14\r\n\r\nColoring games and color by number activities have been proven to reduce stress and increase mindfulness. As life gets increasingly busy and complicated, making time for simple pleasures becomes more important than ever for wellbeing and happiness.\r\n \r\nAs one of the best choices for your coloring, Fun color will provide the user with thousands of pics in more than 20 categories! You will be able to find in Fun Color:\r\n \r\nDarkness\ud83d\udc7d\r\nSexy lady\ud83d\udc93\r\nCharacter\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69\r\nBeast\ud83d\udc2f\r\nFlower\ud83c\udf39\r\nLove\u2764\ufe0f\r\nScenery\u26f0\ufe0f\r\nAnimal\ud83e\udd8c\r\nSkeleton \u2620\ufe0f\r\nFood\ud83c\udf5c\r\nPrincess\ud83d\udc78\r\nMandala\u2728\r\nFairy\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\u200d\r\nMermaid\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2640\u200d\r\nDog\ud83d\udc36\r\nCat\ud83d\udc31\r\nButterfly\ud83e\udd8b\r\nHolidays\ud83c\udf04\r\nNeon\ud83c\udf86\r\nQuote\ud83d\udcd6\r\nGalaxy\ud83c\udf03\u2728\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\r\nSpecial categories\uff1a\r\nStory series pictures\ud83c\udfac\r\nAnimated pictures\ud83d\udc8b\r\nMysterious pictures\u2753\r\nMusical pictures\ud83c\udfb5\r\n\r\n\r\nYou are sure to find pictures you like! Join Fun Color now!\r\n\r\nFun Color - Happy Coloring Games aims to provide you with a creative and relaxing outlet to unwind while adding beautiful colors to delightful illustrations.\r\n\r\nExclusive features:\r\n\ud83e\udd84- Start coloring anytime, anywhere - no pencil, or paper needed\r\nHave no idea about how to paint? Don't worry. Fun Color will help you make painting easy. It creates a new way for the users to enjoy coloring and painting without specific skills, pencils, or paper. All you need do is choose the number you want to paint and color, then tap the shade to follow the clues, happy coloring games!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8b- Easily complete your extraordinary pictures\r\nIn Fun Color, each picture you want to color has light gray lines as the guide for you to paint. You can color by number with just one hand or even one figure! Come on, guys! Let's create your great coloring pictures anytime, anywhere\uff01fun coloring book\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd8b- Daily updated hot new designed paintings \r\nIn Fun Color, we will provide you with tons of paint color choices and update  paintings every day. There are various coloring pages of different types, and you can color by number with people and animals, flowers and landscapes, special unicorns and mandalas, etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd70 - Unique and extraordinary variety of themed categories\r\n Popular and exclusive featured themes will also be updated weekly: PAW Patrol, The Vampire Strikes Back, Wedding Dream, Winter Bugle, Enchanted Cat, Halloween, etc. A lot of exciting and relaxing content is waiting for you to color.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89- Quick sharing. Show your artwork to friends on social networks\r\nYou can easily download your finished paintings, share them with your friends, and post them on social networks (Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, and so on).\r\n\r\nIf you have any suggestions for Fun Color: Happy Coloring Book, please get in touch with us at Funcolor.feedback@gmail.com\r\n\r\nFun Color - Happy Coloring Games will awaken your inner artist with whimsical inspirations on every page. Unleash your creativity and express yourself through color.  Whatever your mood, you will find joyful coloring pages to lift your spirits and brighten your day.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color by number a day, leave your stress away!\ud83d\ude04\ud83d\ude04  <br><br>Bring out your inner artist with Fun Color - Happy Coloring Games. This digital coloring book app provides over 5000 intricate coloring pages and color by number templates for you to paint by number. \ud83d\udd14<br><br>Coloring games and color by number activities have been proven to reduce stress and increase mindfulness. As life gets increasingly busy and complicated, making time for simple pleasures becomes more important than ever for wellbeing and happiness.<br> <br>As one of the best choices for your coloring, Fun color will provide the user with thousands of pics in more than 20 categories! You will be able to find in Fun Color:<br> <br>Darkness\ud83d\udc7d<br>Sexy lady\ud83d\udc93<br>Character\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69<br>Beast\ud83d\udc2f<br>Flower\ud83c\udf39<br>Love\u2764\ufe0f<br>Scenery\u26f0\ufe0f<br>Animal\ud83e\udd8c<br>Skeleton \u2620\ufe0f<br>Food\ud83c\udf5c<br>Princess\ud83d\udc78<br>Mandala\u2728<br>Fairy\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\u200d<br>Mermaid\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2640\u200d<br>Dog\ud83d\udc36<br>Cat\ud83d\udc31<br>Butterfly\ud83e\udd8b<br>Holidays\ud83c\udf04<br>Neon\ud83c\udf86<br>Quote\ud83d\udcd6<br>Galaxy\ud83c\udf03\u2728\ud83c\udf1f<br>\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026<br>Special categories\uff1a<br>Story series pictures\ud83c\udfac<br>Animated pictures\ud83d\udc8b<br>Mysterious pictures\u2753<br>Musical pictures\ud83c\udfb5<br><br><br>You are sure to find pictures you like! Join Fun Color now!<br><br>Fun Color - Happy Coloring Games aims to provide you with a creative and relaxing outlet to unwind while adding beautiful colors to delightful illustrations.<br><br>Exclusive features:<br>\ud83e\udd84- Start coloring anytime, anywhere - no pencil, or paper needed<br>Have no idea about how to paint? Don&#39;t worry. Fun Color will help you make painting easy. It creates a new way for the users to enjoy coloring and painting without specific skills, pencils, or paper. All you need do is choose the number you want to paint and color, then tap the shade to follow the clues, happy coloring games!<br><br>\ud83d\udc8b- Easily complete your extraordinary pictures<br>In Fun Color, each picture you want to color has light gray lines as the guide for you to paint. You can color by number with just one hand or even one figure! Come on, guys! Let&#39;s create your great coloring pictures anytime, anywhere\uff01fun coloring book<br><br>\ud83e\udd8b- Daily updated hot new designed paintings <br>In Fun Color, we will provide you with tons of paint color choices and update  paintings every day. There are various coloring pages of different types, and you can color by number with people and animals, flowers and landscapes, special unicorns and mandalas, etc.<br><br>\ud83e\udd70 - Unique and extraordinary variety of themed categories<br> Popular and exclusive featured themes will also be updated weekly: PAW Patrol, The Vampire Strikes Back, Wedding Dream, Winter Bugle, Enchanted Cat, Halloween, etc. A lot of exciting and relaxing content is waiting for you to color.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf89- Quick sharing. Show your artwork to friends on social networks<br>You can easily download your finished paintings, share them with your friends, and post them on social networks (Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, and so on).<br><br>If you have any suggestions for Fun Color: Happy Coloring Book, please get in touch with us at Funcolor.feedback@gmail.com<br><br>Fun Color - Happy Coloring Games will awaken your inner artist with whimsical inspirations on every page. Unleash your creativity and express yourself through color.  Whatever your mood, you will find joyful coloring pages to lift your spirits and brighten your day.",
